id: people-swap
name: People Swap
advancement: true
prerequisite: 3+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 5
# Two targeted, asked when it is used: a Clash against each, and both won, the Swap button swaps them.
peopleSwap: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Position Change at two targets: both Clashes won, they swap places instead of you.
text: >
  People Swap: You are able to swap around two combatants on the battlefield.
  –Prerequisites: 3+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: Instead of a single target, you may choose two targets within the AoE for the effects of Position Change. If
  you win the Clash against both Characters, you may swap their positions on the Battlefield instead of changing yours.
